Holding Institution","id":"https://data.okeeffemuseum.org/terms/caption_instituion"}],"content":"Milwaukee Art Museum","type":"LinguisticObject"},{"classified_as":[{"_label":"credit line","id":"https://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300026687"}],"content":"Milwaukee Art Museum, Gift of Mrs. Harry Lynde Bradley M1973.609","type":"LinguisticObject"},{"classified_as":[{"_label":"Materials description","id":"https://data.okeeffemuseum.org/terms/materials_description"}],"content":"Oil on canvas","type":"LinguisticObject"},{"classified_as":[{"_label":"Measurement Description","id":"https://data.okeeffemuseum.org/terms/measurement_description"}],"content":"36 x 30 inches","type":"LinguisticObject"},{"classified_as":[{"_label":"Caption - Copyright","id":"https://data.okeeffemuseum.org/terms/caption_copyright"}],"content":"© Georgia O'Keeffe Museum","type":"LinguisticObject"},{"classified_as":[{"_label":"cr_remarks_1999","id":"https://data.okeeffemuseum.org/terms/local/cr_remarks_1999"}],"content":["Whitney Archive indicates, \"Painted 1944.\" (Source: Lynes, 1999)"],"type":"LinguisticObject"},{"classified_as":[{"_label":"Caption - Complete","id":"https://data.okeeffemuseum.org/terms/caption_complete"}],"content":"Georgia O'Keeffe. Pelvis I, 1944. Oil on canvas, 36 x 30 inches. Milwaukee Art Museum. Milwaukee Art Museum, Gift of Mrs. Harry Lynde Bradley M1973.609. © Georgia O'Keeffe Museum","type":"LinguisticObject"},{"classified_as":[{"_label":"Caption - Artist(s)","id":"https://data.okeeffemuseum.org/terms/caption_artist"}],"content":"Georgia O'Keeffe","type":"LinguisticObject"},{"classified_as":[{"_label":"Caption - Title and Date","id":"https://data.okeeffemuseum.org/terms/caption_title_date"}],"content":"Pelvis I, 1944","type":"LinguisticObject"},{"classified_as":[{"_label":"provenance_narrative","id":"https://data.okeeffemuseum.org/terms/local/provenance_narrative"}],"content":"[1] Through at least January 22, 1945, the artist [1887–1986] (Santa Fe, New Mexico, USA). [2] (Doris Bry, New York, New York, USA). [3] December 26, 1972, purchased from the artist [1887–1986] (USA) by Mrs. Harry Lynde (Margaret, or Peg, Blakney Sullivan) Bradley [1894–1978] (Milwaukee, Wisconsin, USA); [4] December 6/December 31, 1973, purchased by her daughter, Jane Bradley Pettit; [5] December 6/December 31, 1973, gift to Milwaukee Art Center (Milwaukee, Wisconsin, USA) \nNOTES: \n[1] An American Place, Georgia O'Keeffe: Paintings, 1944 (New York: An American Place, 1945), cat. 4. \n[2] Barbara Buhler Lynes, Georgia O'Keeffe: Catalogue Raisonné. Vol. 2 (New Haven: Yale University Press, 1999), p. 677, cat. 1075. \n[3], [4], [5] Documentation found in the MAM object file, including purchase agreement and invoice addressed to Mrs. Harry Lynde Bradley, signed by Peg on January 2, 1973 and marked paid by “MBB” on December 6, 1973. Report from The Bradley Family Foundation records that Peg’s daughter, Jane Bradley Pettit, purchased the painting in December 1973 before it was given to the Museum. See also Agreement between Milwaukee Art Center, Peg Bradley, and Jane Bradley Pettit, December 30, 1977. Gerald Nordland, 1977–1984, Box 4, Folder 01a. Museum Administration 02-ADM. Milwaukee Art Museum—Institutional Archives. See also Barbara Buhler Lynes, Georgia O'Keeffe: Catalogue Raisonné. Vol. 2 (New Haven: Yale University Press, 1999), p. 677, cat. 1075. Jane Bradley owned the artwork at the time of the gift. Periodically, Peg would purchase an artwork and then sell it to Jane; this is known to also have happened with Kees van Dongen's \"The Quai, Venice\" (M1973.610). \n(Source: MAM, 2025)","type":"LinguisticObject"},{"classified_as":[{"_label":"Caption - Medium and Dimensions","id":"https://data.okeeffemuseum.org/terms/caption_medium_dims"}],"content":"Oil on canvas, 36 x 30 inches","type":"LinguisticObject"}],"representation":[{"digitally_shown_by":[{"access_point":[{"id":"https://iiif.okeeffemuseum.org/image/iiif/2/862536/full/full/0/default.jpg","type":"DigitalObject"}],"classified_as":[{"_label":"Digital Image","id":"http://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300215302","type":"Type"}],"digitally_available_via":[{"access_point":[{"id":"https://iiif.okeeffemuseum.org/image/iiif/2/862536"}],"conforms_to":[{"id":"http://iiif.io/api/image","type":"InformationObject"}],"format":"application/ld+json;profile='http://iiif.io/api/image/2/context.json'","type":"DigitalService"}],"type":"DigitalObject"}],"type":"VisualItem"}],"type":"HumanMadeObject"}